{"title": "The Road Zipper System® - a smarter, safer and faster way to manage congestion and improve the way people move on the road", "description": "One of the greatest benefits of the Road Zipper System® is the fact that it lifts the unanchored CRTS barrier and can move it one or two lanes and sit it down without damaging the roadway. This cost-effective, reusable solution can easily reconfigure travel lanes in real time (transfers typically take place at 6-8 miles per hour in continuous motion), all while maintaining a secure barrier between lanes.\n\nWatch the video below to get an up-close view of how it the system works!\n\nLearn more about the Road Zipper moveable barrier system here: https://www.lindsay.com/usca/en/infrastructure/brands/road-zipper/\n\n#RoadZipper #LindsayCorporation #LindsayTransportation #LindsayInfrastructure #mobility", "uploader": "Lindsay Infrastructure", "uploader_id": "100063566710712", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t15.5256-10/132015516_808066746591164_3034358559185712685_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_tt6&cstp=mx1920x1080&ctp=s960x960&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=50ce42&_nc_ohc=fHRp2vEG29cQ7kNvwESyIbW&_nc_oc=Adrgia4_C60Bw9f84DXsKuKd7RYpteZAh6oZOfJuvEOJ-uFXgD3zx0gm1p9DnQLcnnY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.xx&_nc_gid=muwSZNqJJ6UTt62aa-gJgA&_nc_ss=70289&oh=00_AQQyxWyUHM3d1-W-PhCn_EeyAFBU3ZiBUYzE0KnPnGF1Ew&oe=6AF88B08", "view_count": 300, "concurrent_view_count": 0, "duration": 62.162, "id": "808064986591340", "formats": [{"format_id": "sd", "quality": -3, "url": "https://video-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m412/AQMro9vBkp5ynMS1Yw22bJ09jkULRMNLNz1lSE6vE3jZzM-ppWicnLOmKsrcCFbf9MDIViH7qOnwBKhYjJBY964c.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=8bf8fe&_nc_ht=video-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=atlGqAGwH28Q7kNvwFawcOE&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5GQUNFQk9PSy4uQzMuNDI2LnN2ZV9zZCIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MzkyNzY2NDYzMTIzODQ0LCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6MjExMCwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTAxMjIsImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjYyLCJ1c